  "definitions": {
    "validVoteShare": "INC candidate votes divided by all valid candidate votes across the entire reported state or territory, multiplied by 100. NOTA and invalid votes are excluded. It is not vote share only in constituencies contested by INC.",
    "strikeRate": "Seats won divided by constituencies contested by INC, multiplied by 100. Zero contested seats produces null, not zero.",
    "seatsContested": "Number of distinct constituencies with an INC candidate in ECI report 33. A person contesting two constituencies counts twice. Rejected or withdrawn nominations and allied or independent candidates are excluded.",
    "comparison": "35 non-overlapping comparable areas cover all 36 reported units in each year. Reorganised units are aggregated explicitly from raw votes, valid-vote denominators and counts.",
    "precision": "Shares and percentage-point changes are calculated from integer votes and denominators before rounding to two decimal places. Subtracting already rounded display values may differ by 0.01 pp."
  },
